Files not covered, or covered only in part, by the GPL grant
------------------------------------------------------------

An audit of this repository found no file copied from Oracle-, Red Hat- or
IBM-owned material: there is no copy of an Oracle patch, README, SQL script,
response-file template or binary, and no copy of a Red Hat or IBM script or
binary. The following file is written by this project but reproduces parts of
an Oracle-defined format. It is covered by the GPL only to the extent this
project authored it:

- roles/oracle_database_patch_role/files/database_patch.bash
  Its qopiprep mode (AIX, Oracle Database 12.1 only) recreates the
  OPATCH_XML_INV external table. The table definition (column, access
  parameters, preprocessor and file names) and the SYS.DBMS_QOPATCH and
  DBMS_SQLPATCH interfaces it calls are defined by Oracle and remain subject
  to Oracle's terms. The script's own logic, structure and comments are
  project code under the GPL.

